Before authorizing access to the system or performing assigned duties;
When required by system changes; and {{ insert: param, at-03_odp }} thereafter.

Identify the types of events that the system is capable of logging to support the audit function: {{ insert: param, au-02_odp.01 }};
Coordinate the event logging function with other organizational entities to ensure that the logging function does not degrade or impede the logging function or the logging enforcement function and to provide and inform the selection criteria for events to be logged;
Specify the following event types for logging within the system: {{ insert: param, au-2_prm_2 }};
Provide a rationale for why the event types selected for logging are adequate to support after-the-fact investigations of incidents; and
